WEBVTT

00:25.483 --> 00:29.070
That day,
humanity was suddenly reminded...

00:35.035 --> 00:37.996
of the terror of being at their mercy,

00:40.498 --> 00:45.003
of the humiliation
of being trapped inside a cage.

01:03.813 --> 01:05.398
All soldiers, prepare for battle!

01:06.107 --> 01:07.400
We have one target!

01:07.776 --> 01:09.861
We will slay it and claim this area

01:09.944 --> 01:11.780
as humanity's first stronghold
beyond the walls!

01:13.114 --> 01:14.157
Target approaching!

01:19.537 --> 01:21.456
Split into five groups,
just as we practiced!

01:22.582 --> 01:24.501
We'll act as the bait!

01:24.876 --> 01:27.462
All assault squads,
switch to omnidirectional gear!

01:49.317 --> 01:51.361
Strike from all directions at once!

01:56.950 --> 01:58.827
Feel the power

01:59.494 --> 02:00.870
of humanity!

04:06.746 --> 04:08.998
What? Mikasa...

04:09.791 --> 04:11.209
We should be getting back.

04:12.627 --> 04:14.671
What are we doing here?

04:15.922 --> 04:18.549
You must have been sleeping deeply
if you still haven't come to your senses.

04:19.008 --> 04:20.009
No.

04:20.468 --> 04:24.639
It just feels like I had this
really long dream or something.

04:26.641 --> 04:27.976
What was it about?

04:28.685 --> 04:30.019
I can't remember.

04:34.357 --> 04:36.526
Eren, why are you crying?

04:36.985 --> 04:37.819
What?

04:41.823 --> 04:44.117
SHIGANSHINA DISTRICT, YEAR 845

04:47.912 --> 04:48.788
Listen!

04:49.289 --> 04:51.958
It was by God's great wisdom
that the walls were built!

04:52.500 --> 04:55.461
The walls are His divine work!

04:56.129 --> 04:59.757
No one must be allowed
to defile the walls!

05:02.927 --> 05:06.889
Don't you dare tell anyone I was crying.

05:07.223 --> 05:08.224
I won't.

05:09.100 --> 05:12.478
Still, crying for no real reason...

05:12.812 --> 05:14.814
You should have your dad
give you a checkup.

05:14.981 --> 05:18.443
Don't be stupid! I can't tell him!

05:18.693 --> 05:20.445
What were you crying about, Eren?

05:22.739 --> 05:24.032
Mr. Hannes...

05:24.532 --> 05:26.701
Did Mikasa nag you about something?

05:26.909 --> 05:29.537
What makes you think I was crying?

05:29.787 --> 05:31.372
Whoa, you reek of alcohol!

05:32.540 --> 05:33.833
It's like... Come on, you know?

05:35.543 --> 05:36.836
You're drinking again.

05:37.170 --> 05:38.838
Do you guys want to join in?

05:39.130 --> 05:41.549
Actually... Don't you have work?

05:41.632 --> 05:43.885
Yes! We're guarding the gate today!

05:44.469 --> 05:49.307
We were stuck here all day,
so we ended up getting hungry and thirsty.

05:49.807 --> 05:55.229
If some booze happens to get into
our drinks, so what? It's no big deal.

05:56.689 --> 05:58.858
What if something happens?
Can you fight like that?

06:00.651 --> 06:03.321
- What do you mean, "if something happens"?
- You know what I mean!

06:03.696 --> 06:06.657
I'm talking about if they break the walls
and get into the city!

06:10.119 --> 06:11.621
It hurts.

06:11.788 --> 06:14.916
Jeez, Eren. Don't go yelling like that.

06:16.459 --> 06:18.920
The doctor's son has some spunk!

06:19.378 --> 06:23.424
If they do bust down the walls,
we'll take care of business. Don't worry.

06:23.758 --> 06:27.845
But that hasn't happened even once
in the last hundred years.

06:28.054 --> 06:28.971
My dad says

06:29.305 --> 06:33.226
there's nothing more dangerous
than being complacent!

06:33.684 --> 06:35.353
Dr. Jaeger?

06:35.770 --> 06:37.105
Yes, he's got a point.

06:37.355 --> 06:41.484
He once saved this town from an epidemic.

06:42.193 --> 06:44.445
I can't argue with him.

06:44.779 --> 06:47.365
Still, they're different stories
altogether.

06:48.991 --> 06:52.787
When you're a soldier, you get to see
those things roaming around outside

06:52.870 --> 06:55.081
while you're on
wall reinforcement duty and stuff.

06:55.706 --> 07:00.545
These walls are 50m tall, though.
I can't imagine them getting through.

07:00.878 --> 07:05.383
Then, you're not actually
prepared to fight them at all?

07:05.842 --> 07:06.759
No!

07:07.969 --> 07:08.970
What?

07:09.428 --> 07:11.806
Then drop the "Garrison Regiment" name

07:11.931 --> 07:13.641
and use "Wall Construction Squad" instead!

07:13.724 --> 07:15.435
That's not a bad idea!

07:16.936 --> 07:18.396
But you have to understand, Eren.

07:18.729 --> 07:22.650
If a soldier is doing his job, that means
things have seriously gone to hell.

07:22.942 --> 07:27.405
It's better when everyone's
calling us useless freeloaders.

07:27.655 --> 07:29.782
It means peaceful times for us all.

07:32.660 --> 07:36.289
Sure, we can stay
inside the walls our entire lives

07:36.873 --> 07:39.208
and do nothing but eat and sleep!

07:39.917 --> 07:42.295
But that basically...

07:43.838 --> 07:45.715
that basically makes us cattle!

07:49.218 --> 07:51.471
Man, you're one plucky kid, all right!

07:51.596 --> 07:54.682
For someone who's totally helpless!
Right, Hannes?

07:55.141 --> 07:56.642
What? Yes.

07:58.519 --> 08:00.062
Hey, Eren!

08:01.731 --> 08:03.316
What a weirdo!

08:04.317 --> 08:08.321
Wait. Don't tell me
he wants to join the Scout Regiment?

08:17.622 --> 08:20.791
Eren, I'd forget about joining
the Scout Regiment if I were you.

08:21.876 --> 08:24.837
What? You think the Scout Regiment
is a joke too?

08:25.338 --> 08:27.757
It's not about what I think.

08:34.764 --> 08:36.849
The Scout Regiment is back!

08:37.225 --> 08:38.684
They're going to open the front gate!

08:39.018 --> 08:41.395
Let's go and see
the heroes return, Mikasa!

08:54.408 --> 08:56.202
Damn! I can't see!

09:25.273 --> 09:27.608
They're the only ones who made it back?

09:28.150 --> 09:30.528
Everyone else must have gotten eaten.

09:30.861 --> 09:33.823
That's what they get
for going outside the walls.

09:34.407 --> 09:36.534
Moses!

09:36.993 --> 09:38.202
Excuse me.

09:38.536 --> 09:41.122
I don't see my son, Moses, anywhere.

09:41.330 --> 09:43.124
Do you know where he is?

09:44.709 --> 09:46.419
This is Moses' mother.

09:47.128 --> 09:47.962
Go and get it.

10:14.071 --> 10:16.907
It's all we could retrieve.

10:33.507 --> 10:35.343
But my son...

10:35.926 --> 10:37.803
He was helpful, yes?

10:39.722 --> 10:42.683
Even if he didn't achieve
anything directly,

10:43.225 --> 10:48.272
surely my son's death
helped humanity fight back, yes?

10:54.945 --> 10:55.863
Of course!

11:00.076 --> 11:00.951
No.

11:02.203 --> 11:05.206
During this latest scouting mission, we...

11:05.790 --> 11:06.624
No.

11:07.041 --> 11:08.292
Just like all the other missions,

11:10.836 --> 11:14.548
we didn't achieve anything at all!

11:15.466 --> 11:17.551
My incompetence has done nothing

11:17.968 --> 11:20.429
but needlessly send
soldiers to their deaths!

11:20.888 --> 11:27.311
We haven't found out anything about them!

11:33.442 --> 11:34.985
Talk about gruesome.

11:35.069 --> 11:36.362
You can say that again.

11:36.987 --> 11:41.325
Our taxes are basically going to
fatten those things up now.

11:44.662 --> 11:46.247
What the hell, you little punk?

11:48.874 --> 11:51.127
Hey! What are you doing, Mikasa?

11:51.710 --> 11:53.712
Hey! Get back here!

11:55.756 --> 11:58.342
Mikasa! Enough already!

12:03.848 --> 12:06.684
What's the big idea?
Now the firewood's all over the place!

12:08.227 --> 12:09.061
Eren.

12:09.812 --> 12:13.274
Have you changed your mind
about joining the Scout Regiment?

12:21.532 --> 12:23.742
Help pick this up.

12:25.119 --> 12:26.829
It's not that bad of a mess.

12:34.170 --> 12:35.129
We're home.

12:37.006 --> 12:38.340
Welcome back.

12:41.677 --> 12:45.181
Wow, Eren! You actually worked hard!

12:45.681 --> 12:46.682
Yes.

12:50.436 --> 12:51.479
What do you want?

12:51.770 --> 12:54.940
Your ear's red. That shows you're lying.

12:55.191 --> 12:57.318
You had Mikasa help you, didn't you?

12:58.569 --> 13:01.113
You're leaving, Dad?

13:01.697 --> 13:02.656
Is it for work?

13:02.740 --> 13:05.201
Yes. Some checkups in the interior.

13:05.451 --> 13:06.911
It will take a couple of days.

13:10.414 --> 13:13.667
Eren says he wants to join
the Scout Regiment.

13:18.005 --> 13:20.049
Mikasa! I told you not to say anything!

13:20.132 --> 13:20.966
Eren!

13:21.550 --> 13:23.052
What are you thinking?

13:23.469 --> 13:27.223
Do you have any idea how many people
have died outside the walls?

13:27.515 --> 13:29.725
- Yes, I know!
- Then--

13:29.808 --> 13:30.643
Eren.

13:32.520 --> 13:35.147
Why do you want to go out there?

13:36.774 --> 13:40.528
I want to know
what the outside world is like!

13:41.070 --> 13:44.698
I don't want to live my entire life
in ignorance inside the walls!

13:45.491 --> 13:46.534
Plus,

13:47.326 --> 13:49.620
if no one else is willing
to take their place,

13:50.538 --> 13:53.249
then everyone's deaths
will have been in vain!

13:57.461 --> 13:58.420
I see.

14:00.589 --> 14:03.092
My boat's about to leave.
I better get going.

14:03.425 --> 14:06.428
Hold on, dear! Talk some sense into Eren!

14:06.512 --> 14:07.388
Carla.

14:07.721 --> 14:12.768
Words can't hold back human curiosity.

14:13.435 --> 14:14.270
Eren.

14:15.729 --> 14:18.607
When I get back,
I'll show you the basement

14:18.732 --> 14:20.568
that I've kept secret all this time.

14:21.735 --> 14:22.862
Really?

14:26.782 --> 14:28.450
Take care!

14:30.828 --> 14:32.037
Just forget it.

14:33.455 --> 14:35.165
Joining the Scout Regiment
is a stupid idea!

14:35.374 --> 14:37.376
What? Stupid?

14:37.459 --> 14:42.256
People who don't mind living
like livestock are the stupid ones!

14:42.631 --> 14:43.549
Eren!

14:46.844 --> 14:47.803
Mikasa.

14:48.304 --> 14:50.598
He gets himself into trouble so easily.

14:51.098 --> 14:53.267
If anything happens,
you need to be there for each other!

14:54.101 --> 14:54.977
Yes.

14:58.230 --> 14:59.648
What's the matter, you heretic?

15:00.941 --> 15:03.527
If you don't like it, hit back!

15:04.695 --> 15:06.322
As if!

15:06.655 --> 15:08.699
That would be stooping to your level!

15:08.866 --> 15:09.950
Say what?

15:10.159 --> 15:13.120
You know I'm right!

15:13.537 --> 15:16.248
That's why you resort to violence!
Because you can't argue back!

15:16.999 --> 15:20.002
Which means you concede to me, doesn't it?

15:21.629 --> 15:23.923
Shut up, smart-ass!

15:24.089 --> 15:25.132
Stop that!

15:27.134 --> 15:28.135
It's Eren!

15:28.677 --> 15:31.764
- That idiot's back for more?
- Does he want his ass kicked?

15:31.847 --> 15:33.349
We'll tear you a new one!

15:34.558 --> 15:36.518
Mikasa's with him!

15:37.061 --> 15:39.605
Screw this! Let's get out of here!

15:45.194 --> 15:47.780
Just one look at me and they ran off!

15:48.030 --> 15:50.532
No, it was Mikasa they saw.

15:52.159 --> 15:54.119
Hey! You okay, Armin?

15:58.457 --> 16:00.125
I can get up on my own.

16:00.918 --> 16:01.919
I see.

16:05.172 --> 16:10.094
I said humanity needs to venture
into the outside world at some point,

16:10.219 --> 16:12.388
but then they beat me up
and called me a heretic.

16:12.513 --> 16:13.639
Damn.

16:15.557 --> 16:19.353
Why does everyone look down on people
who want to go outside?

16:19.520 --> 16:22.398
Well, it's because
we've had a hundred years of peace

16:22.481 --> 16:24.566
by staying inside the walls.

16:24.942 --> 16:27.027
They're worried
that going outside carelessly

16:27.111 --> 16:29.947
will invite them inside the walls.

16:30.114 --> 16:32.282
The Royal Government's policies have made

16:32.366 --> 16:35.995
having any interest
in the outside world a taboo.

16:36.370 --> 16:39.498
It's our lives!
We can risk them if we want!

16:39.748 --> 16:41.041
Absolutely not.

16:43.293 --> 16:44.128
Forget about it.

16:44.628 --> 16:47.589
Which reminds me,
I can't believe you told my parents!

16:47.756 --> 16:48.590
What?

16:48.674 --> 16:50.217
I never agreed to help.

16:50.384 --> 16:51.927
So, what did they say?

16:52.469 --> 16:55.347
They're less than pleased.

16:57.057 --> 16:58.058
Figures.

17:02.771 --> 17:05.315
Indeed, I think people are crazy

17:05.399 --> 17:09.278
if they think we'll be
safe inside these walls forever.

17:13.282 --> 17:16.326
Just because the walls
haven't fallen for a hundred years,

17:16.910 --> 17:19.246
it doesn't guarantee
that they won't fall today.

17:21.081 --> 17:22.541
And yet...

17:41.727 --> 17:43.270
What was that?

17:43.437 --> 17:44.480
An explosion?

17:45.731 --> 17:46.899
- That way!
- Did something fall?

17:46.982 --> 17:48.692
I'm not really sure.

17:50.778 --> 17:51.862
Hey, Armin!

17:55.908 --> 17:59.369
What is it? What do you see?

18:09.421 --> 18:10.631
It can't be.

18:10.964 --> 18:14.927
That wall is 50m high!

18:16.386 --> 18:17.554
It's one of them.

18:23.769 --> 18:25.020
A Titan!

19:10.899 --> 19:15.779
It made a hole in the wall.

19:20.659 --> 19:21.743
They're inside!

19:22.035 --> 19:24.454
The Titans have gotten inside!

19:28.041 --> 19:29.042
We need to run too!

19:30.043 --> 19:30.878
Eren!

19:31.086 --> 19:32.504
My house is in that direction.

19:33.213 --> 19:34.256
Mom!

19:35.591 --> 19:36.633
Mikasa!

19:42.723 --> 19:44.308
It's all over.

19:45.184 --> 19:51.273
Countless Titans are going to
overrun the city!

19:57.196 --> 19:58.864
It couldn't have hit our home!

19:59.239 --> 20:02.534
Just around this corner,
our house will stand there, like always!

20:07.164 --> 20:08.332
Mom!

20:10.876 --> 20:11.960
Mom!

20:13.962 --> 20:16.381
- Eren!
- Mikasa! Grab that end!

20:16.590 --> 20:17.841
We have to move this pillar!

20:36.944 --> 20:38.070
Hurry, Mikasa!

20:38.153 --> 20:39.154
I know!

20:40.072 --> 20:42.658
The Titans have gotten inside,
haven't they?

20:43.408 --> 20:45.535
Eren! Take Mikasa and run away!

20:45.744 --> 20:46.787
Hurry!

20:47.162 --> 20:48.747
I want to!

20:48.872 --> 20:50.832
So hurry up and get out of there!

20:51.583 --> 20:54.670
The debris has crushed my legs.

20:55.504 --> 20:57.839
Even if I could get out,
I wouldn't be able to run.

20:58.966 --> 21:01.969
- You know what that means.
- I'll carry you, then!

21:02.052 --> 21:04.680
Why don't you ever listen to your mother?

21:05.305 --> 21:07.474
You can at least do this one last thing!

21:08.141 --> 21:09.226
Mikasa!

21:10.352 --> 21:11.436
No...

21:12.020 --> 21:12.980
No!

21:13.897 --> 21:15.816
If you don't go, all three of us will...

21:17.943 --> 21:18.819
Hannes!

21:21.238 --> 21:23.115
Take the children and get out of here!

21:24.491 --> 21:26.994
Don't underestimate me, Carla.

21:27.452 --> 21:31.290
I'm going to slaughter these Titans
and save all three of you!

21:31.915 --> 21:34.376
Wait! Don't fight them!

21:35.252 --> 21:37.838
Yes, I could save those two for sure.

21:37.921 --> 21:39.131
But now,

21:39.298 --> 21:41.591
I'm finally going to repay
the favor I owe!

21:58.317 --> 22:00.152
Hey! Mr. Hannes!

22:00.277 --> 22:01.945
What are you doing?

22:03.155 --> 22:04.573
- Thank you.
- Hey!

22:05.157 --> 22:07.617
Mom's still...

22:08.076 --> 22:10.287
Eren! Mikasa!

22:11.079 --> 22:13.206
You have to survive!

22:25.927 --> 22:27.679
Don't go...

22:38.148 --> 22:41.902
Stop!

23:15.393 --> 23:18.897
That day,
humanity was suddenly reminded...

23:23.735 --> 23:26.655
of the terror of being at their mercy,

23:28.907 --> 23:33.662
of the humiliation
of being trapped inside a cage.

23:45.674 --> 23:47.175
Shiganshina falls.

23:48.009 --> 23:52.722
Humanity is only allowed
prayers, screams, and death.

23:53.598 --> 23:58.228
Amid this, Eren alone
swears revenge in his small heart.
